sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as Protected API
    participant Registry as Redis Registries
    participant Proof as Device Proof
    participant Replay as Atomic Replay Control
    participant Rate as Rate Limit
    participant Score as R-ATF
    participant Business
    participant Audit as Audit Hash Chain

    Client->>API: Token + client/device ID + timestamp + nonce + signature
    API->>Registry: Validate token, active status, claims, scope
    Registry-->>API: Token metadata + issuance context
    API->>Proof: Verify binding, time window, HMAC proof
    Proof-->>API: valid / invalid
    API->>Replay: Atomically claim nonce and idempotency key
    Replay-->>API: fresh / reused
    API->>Rate: Increment fixed-window counter
    Rate-->>API: request count
    alt Standard controls
        API->>Business: Forward valid request
    else R-ATF
        API->>Score: Evaluate issuance context + allowed history + frequency
        Score-->>API: allow / verify / block
        opt allow
            API->>Business: Forward request
            API->>Registry: Record token use and allowed context
        end
    end
    API->>Audit: Append decision with previous_hash and entry_hash
    API-->>Client: Business response or security response
